          "text": "Ortho-K Myopia Lenses in Pine Beach",
          "html": "Ortho-K Myopia Lenses in Pine Beach",
          "id": "ELntWhLzwo",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>If you’re looking for a way to see clearly without wearing vision correction during the day, ortho-k treatment might be exactly what you’ve been looking for. These specially designed lenses are worn overnight and reshape your eyes while you sleep, so you can wake up with clear vision and go about your day. It’s a simple, non-surgical option that works for both kids and adults.</p>",
          "id": "MsRMCw1GYc",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
