      "nodes": [
        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "How Ortho-K Improves Your Vision",
          "html": "How Ortho-K Improves Your Vision",
          "id": "AOFy62VOnv",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Ortho-k lenses carefully adjust how light enters your eyes by reshaping the cornea overnight. This allows light to focus properly during the day, giving you clear vision without the need for lenses while you’re awake. As long as the lenses are worn consistently at night, the results continue day after day.</p>",
          "id": "7GojuKevA7",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
