          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Why Patients Love Ortho-K",
          "html": "Why Patients Love Ortho-K",
          "id": "2z0zOn7DiZ",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Ortho-k lenses offer a level of flexibility that traditional options don’t:</p><ul><li>Clear vision during the day without glasses or contact lenses</li><li>Great for sports, active lifestyles, and busy routines</li><li>A non-surgical alternative to LASIK</li><li>Ideal for kids as part of a myopia management plan</li></ul>",
          "id": "w5IU0oHDYB",
          "col": 1,
          "origin": "static"
        },
