        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Getting Started with Ortho-K Treatment",
          "html": "Getting Started with Ortho-K Treatment",
          "id": "JRj6t4t7Mo",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>We’ll start with a detailed <a href=\"/eye-care-services/comprehensive-eye-exams/\">eye exam</a> and measurements to determine if ortho-k is right for you. From there, we’ll design custom lenses and show you exactly how to use and care for them.</p><p>It may take a few days for your vision to adjust fully, but we’ll guide you through the process and check in along the way to make sure everything is working as it should.</p>",
          "id": "7i2d3eoMjA",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
